          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Counting aloud, two is 二: yī, èr, sān. In front of a measure word it is 两: 两个人 (liǎng ge rén), two people. èr ge rén is not said."
            }
          ]
        },
