          "title": "Sounds you'll need — 一 moves",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "一 has three spoken tones, and the next syllable picks one."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Counting, and inside numbers and dates, it stays level: yī, èr, sān; 星期一 xīngqīyī."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before a fourth tone it rises: 一个 yí ge. 个 is fourth tone, even when it is said light."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the other three tones it falls: 一天 yì tiān, 一年 yì nián, 一百 yìbǎi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "This book writes the tone you say, as it writes bú shì for 不是."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
