              "text": "A: nǐmen jǐ ge rén — How many of you are there? B: 两个人 liǎng ge rén — Two. A: 你们喝什么 nǐmen hē shénme — What will you drink? B: liǎng bēi chá — Two cups of tea. A: hǎo, nà zhāng zhuōzi — Fine. That table, then. B: nàr yǒu liǎng zhī māo — There are two cats there. A: zhuōzi shàngbian yǒu yì běn shū — And there's a book on the table."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Every count has its measure word: 个 for people, bēi for tea, zhāng for the table, zhī for the cats, běn for the book. And every two is 两 (liǎng)."
